0001  @RUN   ALBANY,76104,CS301,1,20
0002  @APL,I
UNIVERSITY OF MARYLAND APL
CLEAR WS
0003  $CM A SINE WAVE PLOTTED ON THE LINE PRINTER, A STAR TO EACH POINT
      ⍝ A SINE WAVE PLOTTED ON THE LINE PRINTER, A STAR TO EACH POINT
0004  X $AL 0.25$MU$IO 50
      X ← 0.25×⍳ 50
0005  $CM H IS EACH POINT'S ROW, 5 TO $NG5; R IS EVERY ROW, TOP TO BOTTOM
      ⍝ H IS EACH POINT'S ROW, 5 TO ¯5; R IS EVERY ROW, TOP TO BOTTOM
0006  H $AL $FL 0.5+5$MU 1$CI X
      H ← ⌊ 0.5+5× 1○ X
0007  R $AL 6-$IO 11
      R ← 6-⍳ 11
0008  $CM A STAR WHERE THE CURVE IS, A DASH ALONG THE AXIS, ELSE A BLANK
      ⍝ A STAR WHERE THE CURVE IS, A DASH ALONG THE AXIS, ELSE A BLANK
0009  M $AL (2$MU R$SO.=H)$CE(R=0)$SO.$OR 0$MU H
      M ← (2× R∘.=H)⌈(R=0)∘.∨ 0× H
0010  ' -*'$LB 1+M$RB
      ' -*'[ 1+M]
